>
  <SpecDocsLayout>
    <h1 class="page-h1">ETIM crosswalk.</h1>

    <Callout intent="default" label="Planned">
      <p>
        This crosswalk is planned. When the ULC-to-ETIM mapping is published in
        the <a href="https://github.com/ulcspec/ULC" rel="noopener external">spec repository</a>,
        it will render here.
      </p>
      <p>
        ULC schema enum descriptions cite ETIM feature identifiers inline where a
        correspondence exists; the compiled crosswalk document collects them in one
        place.
      </p>
      <p>
        For now, see the <a href="/docs/crosswalks">crosswalks overview</a> for
        all four planned crosswalks and their context.
      </p>
    </Callout>
  </SpecDocsLayout>
